It was almost like in some ways I think you're in Carter's youth like really served you because one you were you couldn't believe you'd been given this and also like you didn't know enough to be dicks like you didn't you weren't cynical right like and you were really yeah I think I my experience of it was almost a blend of what Gloria is saying, I felt like if they gave us time, we were gonna like write one for the ages, we were gonna make a show that really was a classic in which we ended up doing.
在某种程度上，我觉得卡特和你的年轻真的帮了你们，因为一方面，你们不敢相信自己能得到这个机会，另一方面，你们还不够成熟，不会变成混蛋——你们没有变得愤世嫉俗，对吧？而且你们真的很……是的，我觉得我对此的体验有点像格洛丽亚所说的，我觉得如果他们给我们时间，我们就会写出流传后世的作品，我们会创作出一部真正的经典剧集，而我们最后也确实做到了。

